 HOME [BOARDS] MODELS  SOURCES  SETTINGS

+- KEYS ---------------------------------------+
| g       next board: each of your groups,     |
|         then GLOBAL                          |
| p       change period                        |
| m       rank by estimate or by tokens        |
| j / k   move through the standings           |
| y       copy an invite to this group; the    |
|         owner creates it                     |
| c / i   create a group / join with an invite |
|         code                                 |
| o       join or leave the global board       |
| r       reload                               |
| ?       close help                           |
| q       quit                                 |
+----------------------------------------------+
+- READING THE NUMBERS ------------------------+
| $ EST   what the tokens would cost at API    |
|         list prices. It is an estimate, not  |
|         what you paid.                       |
| >=1.2M  a lower bound: part of the usage was |
|         not reported or has no price.        |
| -       not available. It never means zero.  |
| PRICED  the share of tokens the estimate     |
|         covers.                              |
| + 2     rank moved, against the same point   |
|         of the previous period.              |
| !       a daily total above the plausibility |
|         limit. Usage is self-reported.       |
+----------------------------------------------+
1-5 views | g scope | p period | ? help | q quit
